EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Supabase dashboard → Authentication → URL Configuration → Redirect URLs must include:
#   gamercred://auth/callback          (development & production builds)
#   exp://**                           (Expo Go, development only)
#   http://localhost:8081/auth/callback (web dev)
#   https://<your-web-domain>/auth/callback (web prod)
# Authentication → Providers → Google: enable and paste the Google OAuth client ID/secret.

# --- Edge Function secrets (NOT read by the app; never prefix with EXPO_PUBLIC_) ---
# Twitch developer console → register an app → Client ID / Secret (IGDB: games, studios)
# rawg.io/apidocs → API key (RAWG: directors & other creators)
#   npx supabase secrets set IGDB_CLIENT_ID=... IGDB_CLIENT_SECRET=... RAWG_API_KEY=...
#   npx supabase functions deploy igdb-proxy
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are injected automatically.
